6
00:00:26,400 --> 00:00:32,095
Kei hea i te puna mahana

7
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:33,320
Ka taupokina te wairua e te hotoke.

8
00:00:32,095 --> 00:00:36,760
[pūoro]

9
00:00:33,320 --> 00:00:38,645
I rere ai te ora pērā i te pere i ngā rā o mua, o mua

10
00:00:36,760 --> 00:00:39,160
mātou.

