inoi ki te wā o mua mō tētahi whakautu.

26
00:01:18,320 --> 00:01:25,000
Ka ako tātou ki te aroha i te wā makariri, [pūoro]

27
00:01:21,920 --> 00:01:26,360
ina he pungarehu kei roto i ō ringaringa, ehara i te maitai. MŌ,

