49
00:02:20,280 --> 00:02:25,880
ina mate te rama o tetahi i muri i te tatau.

50
00:02:23,480 --> 00:02:29,520
Ka tawhiri mātou i muri i [te puoro] o ngā tereina kua wehe atu,

51
00:02:25,880 --> 00:02:33,160
