52
00:02:29,520 --> 00:02:35,000
Ka ako tātou ki te aroha ki [te puoro] ina mātao haere,

53
00:02:33,160 --> 00:02:36,160
ina he pungarehu kei roto i ngā nikau, [puoro] ā, kāore

54
00:02:35,000 --> 00:02:39,200
