Ka tawhiri mātou i muri i ngā tereina e wehe atu ana, me te ngana

73
00:03:17,959 --> 00:03:22,360
inoi ki te wā o mua mō tētahi whakautu.

74
00:03:20,959 --> 00:03:25,800
Ka ako tātou ki te aroha, [pūoro]

75
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:28,080
i te wā i mātao ai, i te wā i takoto ai ngā pungarehu i roto i ngā nikau, ā,

76
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:31,160
